@Shopera_HostAddress = http://localhost:5208
@ProductId = 1
@StoreId = 1
@StoreSlug = cyprus-tech
@CategoryId = 1

### Paged public catalogue (pageSize is capped at 100)
GET {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=50&sort=newest

### Search/filter/sort without loading all 1,000 products
GET {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/products?search=laptop&categoryId={{CategoryId}}&brand=Shopera&condition=NEW&minimumPrice=100&maximumPrice=2000&inStockOnly=true&sort=price_asc&page=1&pageSize=50

### Complete buyer-safe detail
# Response includes PRODUCT, PRODUCT_INFO, PRODUCT_IMAGE, buyer-safe
# PRODUCT_VARIANT fields, CATEGORY, STORE, and review summary.
# It must never include CostPrice or RowVersion.
GET {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{ProductId}}

### Related products from the same category, excluding the current product
GET {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{ProductId}}/related?page=1&pageSize=4

### Dynamic brand list from visible products (not a hardcoded frontend seed)
GET {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/products/brands?limit=20

### Public category hierarchy and visible product counts
GET {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/categories

### Paged approved/active stores
GET {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/stores?page=1&pageSize=20&search=

### Store detail by numeric ID
GET {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/stores/{{StoreId}}

### Store detail by slug
GET {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/stores/by-slug/{{StoreSlug}}

### Paged products from one store
GET {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/stores/{{StoreId}}/products?page=1&pageSize=50&sort=rating_desc
